lues":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/115895","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115895","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115895.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/115895.patch","merged_at":"2026-02-25T15:34:13Z"},"body":"- This closes #115892\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Old Information (feel free to ignore)\r\n\r\nThis draft PR addresses #115892 and is to do with `[codeblock]` vs `[codeblocks]`\r\n\r\nIt looks like the only EditorSetting which uses this bbcode is `filesystem/import/blender/blender_path`. Currently in 4.6 stable the description for this setting spells it `[codeblock]`, and when the editor is running, it does show it as a codeblock.\r\n\r\nChanging [codeblock] to [codeblocks] (as this draft PR does) means the text does _not_ render as a codeblock, and this prevents godot crashing when viewing `filesystem/import/blender/blender_path` from the project list.\r\n\r\nSo it seems like there is an issue with rendering `[codeblock] ... [/codeblock]` from within the editor settings opened from the project list.\r\n\r\nAlso, I am a little confused at the usage of `[codeblock]` vs `[codeblocks]`, as both seem to being used? But their behaviour looks to be different.\r\n \r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115895/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/115895/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}